   "body": "**Adversarial review (Opus 5.5) — REQUEST CHANGES** — head 77d392df (branch feat/875-subforum-flag-filter, before the PR)\n\n1. **major** — `Packages/HFRKit/Sources/HFRModels/Catalogue/ForumCatalogue+TopicListPath.swift:11-12`: the filtered request uses the short form `forum1.php?config=hfr.inc&cat=13&page=1&subcat=432&owntopic=3`, which no capture shows with a filled `subcat`. `R603d` (meta `url`) requested the long header-link form (`…&subcat=432&sondage=0&owntopic=3&trash=0&trash_post=0&moderation=0&new=0&nojs=0&subcatgroup=0`). If HFR ignores `subcat` in the short form, the category's favourites show as the sub-forum's. Fix: send R603d's exact query when `subcategory` is set (or capture the short form), and record it in the R2 row.\n2. **major** — `Packages/HFRKit/Tests/HFRParsingTests/TopicList/SubforumTargetTests.swift:19` is 145 characters; `swiftlint lint --strict` (ci.yml:28) fails.\n3. **minor** — `docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md` §6c: \"the sub-forum's own page, logged out or in\" overstates; R603d is the filtered `forum1.php`, not the own page; \"own page, logged in\" is pending capture.\n4. **minor** — `HFREndpoint+Topics.swift:7`: stale doc comment (\"subcat (empty)\").\n5. **minor** — `TopicListModel.swift:262-271`: expired cookie with `subcat`: the 301 target is not captured; add to pending captures.\n6. **nit** — `ForumListModel.swift:50`: the « Tous les sujets » row is a `.subforum` without a target; its note says \"ce sous-forum\".\n7. **nit** — `SubforumTarget` is a new public HFRModels type: merged by the core orchestrator (AGENTS §8); say so in the PR body.\n8. **Ledger** — the GAP-023 \"SwiftHFR final\" cell must change (sub-forum no longer disabled); add #875 to `Source`.\n\nHolds: one request on « Tous »; a choice changed during the first load applies on the final reload; failed or superseded loads change nothing; logged out stays on « Tous »; paging keeps `subcat`; defaulted `subcategory:` keeps callers compiling; the request assertions fail without the change.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
